1
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,050
When we were little,

2
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:29,210
you always scrimped and saved

3
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,140
to buy me food.

4
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:34,600
Eat more.

5
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,150
Sixth Master,

6
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,430
what do we do now?

7
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,490
Zhang Dancheng told me this

8
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,320
because he wants to use me

9
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:52,970
to kill Sect Master.

10
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:55,210
Why don't I just kill them all?

11
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,250
Keep them alive.

12
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:58,210
After I kill Sect Master,

13
00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:00,140
I'm going to make them

14
00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:02,010
take the fall.

15
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,170
Scared?

16
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:07,580
Sixth Master,

17
00:01:08,010 --> 00:01:10,860
you picked me out of a pile of corpses.

18
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:12,340
My life is yours.

19
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,090
Whoever you want to kill...

20
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:17,880
I, Fan Yifei, will be the first to strike.

21
00:01:18,730 --> 00:01:19,530
Let's go.

22
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:22,990
Bring Shangguan Chengming along.

23
00:03:09,370 --> 00:03:13,120
[A Prophet]

24
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:16,260
[Episode 23]

25
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:25,150
Bringing you two back means

26
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:27,340
I've completed Sect Master's task.

27
00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:28,640
After tonight,

28
00:03:28,970 --> 00:03:30,410
the act you and your mentor put on

29
00:03:30,410 --> 00:03:31,650
can come to an end.

30
00:03:32,050 --> 00:03:33,450
After I kill Sect Master,

31
00:03:34,180 --> 00:03:35,410
I'll let you go.

32
00:03:36,250 --> 00:03:37,460
I may be a scoundrel,

33
00:03:38,570 --> 00:03:40,130
but I keep my word.

34
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:41,110
[Equally Adept at the Pen and the Sword]

35
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:00,130
What is it?

36
00:04:08,250 --> 00:04:09,310
I know everything.

37
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,560
Know what?

38
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:14,580
You killed my mother.

39
00:04:19,810 --> 00:04:20,540
Yes.

40
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,400
You've been lying to me all these years.

41
00:04:26,810 --> 00:04:27,450
Yes.

42
00:04:29,210 --> 00:04:30,100
Why?

43
00:04:32,370 --> 00:04:33,330
I felt like it.

44
00:04:35,010 --> 00:04:35,810
Then today,

45
00:04:37,010 --> 00:04:38,500
let's settle this score.

46
00:04:40,130 --> 00:04:41,190
How do we settle it?

47
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,180
With your life.

48
00:04:48,230 --> 00:04:48,790
Wait!

49
00:04:50,659 --> 00:04:51,720
Since it's the end,

50
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:54,820
you should at least
let me say my last words.

51
00:04:56,740 --> 00:04:57,450
Go on.

52
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,970
I only have one request.

53
00:05:04,690 --> 00:05:07,010
I want to hear you call me

54
00:05:07,010 --> 00:05:07,860
Dad.

55
00:05:09,510 --> 00:05:11,120
Then I can die in peace.

56
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,120
Call me Dad.

57
00:05:19,180 --> 00:05:19,860
Go on.

58
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:24,550
Say it.

59
00:05:26,450 --> 00:05:27,420
What's wrong?

60
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:30,100
Can't say it?

61
00:05:31,020 --> 00:05:32,880
Or do you think I don't deserve it?

62
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:39,620
No way.

63
00:05:40,060 --> 00:05:41,940
Is it that hard?

64
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,310
I raised you since you were little.

65
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:58,630
I sent you to a private school
to learn to read,

66
00:05:58,690 --> 00:06:00,660
hired Flying Dagger Li from Shanxi

67
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:02,450
to teach you martial arts,

68
00:06:03,370 --> 00:06:05,130
and let you live a decent life.

69
00:06:05,150 --> 00:06:08,500
I remember that when you
first joined the sect, you were about 10.

70
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:10,030
Those Batous bullied you,

71
00:06:10,050 --> 00:06:12,230
stole all the food in your bowl,
leaving you with

72
00:06:12,230 --> 00:06:13,750
only steamed cornbread to eat.

73
00:06:13,750 --> 00:06:15,570
You hid behind this house and cried.

74
00:06:15,570 --> 00:06:16,700
When I witnessed it,

75
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:17,940
without hesitation,

76
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:19,060
I gave them 10 lashes each.

77
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:21,540
From then on, you had meat, endless meat,

78
00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:23,180
every day.

79
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:25,450
I made that happen.

80
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:26,890
For this alone,

81
00:06:26,910 --> 00:06:29,960
shouldn't you call me Dad?

82
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,600
There's more.

83
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:32,820
When you were 15,

84
00:06:32,890 --> 00:06:34,450
you had a huge boil on your butt,

85
00:06:34,450 --> 00:06:35,770
as big as an egg.

86
00:06:35,770 --> 00:06:37,500
No doctor could cure it.

87
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:38,570
I had no choice

88
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,520
but to cut it open with a knife,

89
00:06:40,890 --> 00:06:42,690
put my mouth on your butt cheek,

90
00:06:43,100 --> 00:06:44,659
and suck the pus out.

91
00:06:44,690 --> 00:06:46,330
I sucked it for 7 days,

92
00:06:46,690 --> 00:06:47,950
before you got better.

93
00:06:48,250 --> 00:06:49,909
You told me not to tell anyone.

94
00:06:50,060 --> 00:06:51,120
I knew you were embarrassed,

95
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,120
so I didn't breathe a word to anyone.

96
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:54,620
You even said,

97
00:06:55,330 --> 00:06:56,010
"Master,

98
00:06:57,420 --> 00:07:00,660
you treat me better than my own mother."

99
00:07:01,810 --> 00:07:03,610
Even with this,

100
00:07:04,370 --> 00:07:07,570
you still can't call me Dad?

101
00:07:11,180 --> 00:07:11,740
Say it.

102
00:07:15,890 --> 00:07:16,690
Say it.

103
00:07:20,330 --> 00:07:20,860
Dad.

104
00:07:21,330 --> 00:07:23,540
Louder.

105
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:26,210
Dad!

106
00:07:26,210 --> 00:07:27,010
Good!

107
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:30,250
You can still call me Dad!

108
00:07:30,420 --> 00:07:31,890
Thank you!

109
00:07:31,890 --> 00:07:33,370
You still want to kill me!

110
00:07:33,370 --> 00:07:35,130
Thank you!

111
00:07:35,130 --> 00:07:37,130
You ingrate!

112
00:07:37,130 --> 00:07:39,770
You'd have starved to death without me!

113
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:40,890
Even if you lived,

114
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:43,940
you'd just be some lousy fisherman
in a seaside village.

115
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:45,300
I killed your mother

116
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:47,100
to cut off your attachments,

117
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:50,300
so you could start anew!

118
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:52,100
And you still want to kill me?

119
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:56,740
Dad...

120
00:07:58,940 --> 00:07:59,810
Go.

121
00:08:00,570 --> 00:08:02,860
Get my shoe back.

122
00:08:37,330 --> 00:08:38,419
Come.

123
00:08:38,730 --> 00:08:40,179
Put it on for me.

124
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,170
Why couldn't you just

125
00:08:52,570 --> 00:08:54,090
make it easy on yourself?

126
00:09:08,970 --> 00:09:10,780
Now it's my turn to ask you.

127
00:09:11,660 --> 00:09:13,970
Any last words?

128
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:16,060
Mother,

129
00:09:18,180 --> 00:09:19,810
why do I feel...

130
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:21,610
so wronged

131
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:24,420
inside?

132
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:32,730
I taught you:

133
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:34,730
to kill,

134
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:37,390
you must be ruthless

135
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:39,810
and swift.

136
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:43,060
You just think too much.

137
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:54,210
Did you really think I wouldn't know

138
00:09:54,210 --> 00:09:55,670
what you've been plotting

139
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:57,140
behind my back?

140
00:09:58,060 --> 00:10:00,850
Heavy is my mantle of leadership.

141
00:10:01,690 --> 00:10:02,810
There's no hurry.

142
00:10:03,380 --> 00:10:05,710
I'll personally escort you onto the stage

143
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:08,450
and let you put on a one-man show.

144
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:10,570
Take him away.

145
00:10:12,660 --> 00:10:13,810
You, stay.

146
00:10:19,490 --> 00:10:20,570
See that?

147
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:25,160
Are you scared?

148
00:10:25,940 --> 00:10:26,660
I am.

149
00:10:29,610 --> 00:10:30,940
From now on,

150
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,940
you are him:

151
00:10:34,450 --> 00:10:35,940
the Sixth Batou.

152
00:10:40,090 --> 00:10:41,210
Thank you, Master.

153
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:45,940
Notify the Batous to gather
in the ancestral hall.

154
00:11:06,970 --> 00:11:08,330
Sixth Batou is dead.

155
00:11:13,570 --> 00:11:14,850
He died because of you.

156
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,090
Back then, you bribed Lu Qinhai

157
00:11:18,090 --> 00:11:20,020
to kill Master Swindler's mother.

158
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:21,850
You kept it from him for so many years.

159
00:11:21,850 --> 00:11:23,490
When Master Swindler learned of the truth,

160
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:24,780
you silenced him.

161
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:28,380
This is your venerable sect master.

162
00:11:28,660 --> 00:11:30,090
Shut up!

163
00:11:30,970 --> 00:11:33,660
It was Sect Master
who saved Master Swindler

164
00:11:33,660 --> 00:11:35,490
and buried his mother back then.

165
00:11:35,970 --> 00:11:36,940
Brothers,

166
00:11:37,260 --> 00:11:39,660
it goes without saying how well

167
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:41,260
Sect Leader has treated you.

168
00:11:41,450 --> 00:11:43,420
I believe you all know it in your hearts.

169
00:11:43,420 --> 00:11:45,020
Don't let this rogue's nonsense

170
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:46,820
cause friction within the sect!

171
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:48,490
Baichuan,

172
00:11:48,490 --> 00:11:50,020
calm down.

173
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:51,540
Sit.

174
00:11:51,540 --> 00:11:52,180
I've survived

175
00:11:52,180 --> 00:11:55,090
so many years amid rumors.
People have said

176
00:11:55,090 --> 00:11:56,660
all kinds of things about me.

177
00:11:56,660 --> 00:11:58,020
When we were young,

178
00:11:58,210 --> 00:12:01,020
some even said I killed
the old sect master.

179
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:02,610
Those who say these things

180
00:12:02,640 --> 00:12:05,240
simply want to
revolt against Tianxiang Sect.

181
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:07,970
What's more terrifying is

182
00:12:08,350 --> 00:12:10,550
that there are our own people involved.

183
00:12:10,940 --> 00:12:12,330
I know very well that

184
00:12:13,330 --> 00:12:15,140
it's more than just one or two.

185
00:12:15,540 --> 00:12:17,020
But don't worry.

186
00:12:17,450 --> 00:12:19,300
As long as I sit on this throne,

187
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:22,400
I won't let the century-old foundation
of Tianxiang Sect

188
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:23,570
go up in flames.

189
00:12:39,730 --> 00:12:39,970
Master.

190
00:12:39,970 --> 00:12:40,380
Senior!

191
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:40,900
Master!

192
00:12:41,380 --> 00:12:41,850
What's wrong?

193
00:12:41,850 --> 00:12:42,900
Master, what's wrong?

194
00:12:42,900 --> 00:12:43,610
Master.

195
00:12:44,170 --> 00:12:45,300
The tea is poisoned.

196
00:12:46,170 --> 00:12:48,850
Lock Shangguan Chengming up!

197
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:49,720
Yes!

198
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:52,730
Master.

199
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,550
Senior, are you okay?

200
00:13:01,020 --> 00:13:02,420
Are you alright, Master?

201
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:06,130
Quick, go brew some alum soup

202
00:13:06,570 --> 00:13:07,540
to detoxify me.

203
00:13:09,060 --> 00:13:10,580
No one follow me.

204
00:13:11,140 --> 00:13:13,730
Let me meditate and channel my qi alone

205
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:16,130
to try to purge the poison.

206
00:13:17,610 --> 00:13:18,610
Careful, Master.

207
00:13:19,150 --> 00:13:20,240
I'll go right away.

208
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:36,940
Old man.

209
00:13:37,970 --> 00:13:40,370
You still have to rely on me
when it matters.

210
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:42,440
I know this place well.

211
00:13:44,810 --> 00:13:47,380
How did you escape from Fan Yifei?

212
00:13:48,540 --> 00:13:50,260
Those small fry under him

213
00:13:50,420 --> 00:13:52,680
can't trap me, the Tongbei Spinning Top.

214
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:54,040
And Chengming warned me

215
00:13:54,070 --> 00:13:55,070
to drink less.

216
00:13:55,570 --> 00:13:56,430
He doesn't know

217
00:13:56,540 --> 00:13:58,670
it takes a sea of booze to get me buzzed.

218
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,480
Are you okay?

219
00:14:02,690 --> 00:14:03,420
I'm fine.

220
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:09,390
Where's Chengming?

221
00:14:11,190 --> 00:14:12,070
Who's there?

222
00:14:16,690 --> 00:14:17,720
I'm your father!

223
00:14:24,550 --> 00:14:25,400
Stop!

224
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:27,940
Stop!

225
00:14:41,660 --> 00:14:42,260
Mentor.

226
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:45,880
The police tipped Sect Master off
in advance.

227
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,250
Fan Yifei also turned against us.

228
00:14:47,250 --> 00:14:48,730
They're trying to
pin Master Swindler's death

229
00:14:48,730 --> 00:14:49,380
on me

230
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:50,710
and accuse me of mutiny.

231
00:14:50,970 --> 00:14:51,570
Done.

232
00:14:51,570 --> 00:14:52,540
Leave the premises now.

233
00:14:52,540 --> 00:14:53,180
Okay.

234
00:14:55,060 --> 00:14:55,780
Feiyan,

235
00:14:56,300 --> 00:14:58,490
forget about your lover.

236
00:14:58,660 --> 00:15:00,660
Shangguan Chengming is absolutely

237
00:15:00,810 --> 00:15:02,180
done for this time.

238
00:15:02,230 --> 00:15:04,210
Instead of worrying about Master's health,

239
00:15:04,210 --> 00:15:05,900
you're here being sarcastic.

240
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,160
Where are you going?

241
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,330
To find a doctor for Sect Master.

242
00:15:09,330 --> 00:15:10,430
Should I just stand here

243
00:15:10,430 --> 00:15:11,760
doing nothing like you?

244
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:13,200
Stop right there!

245
00:15:13,690 --> 00:15:15,110
No one can leave the premises

246
00:15:15,110 --> 00:15:16,900
until Sect Master comes out.

247
00:15:30,730 --> 00:15:31,450
Senior.

248
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:33,690
The medicine is here.

249
00:15:41,970 --> 00:15:42,810
Senior?

250
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:45,020
Senior?

251
00:15:51,090 --> 00:15:51,900
Senior?

252
00:15:52,690 --> 00:15:53,490
Senior!

253
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:54,690
Senior!

254
00:16:13,690 --> 00:16:14,490
Senior!

255
00:16:32,140 --> 00:16:32,970
Senior?

256
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:37,090
Senior.

257
00:16:40,940 --> 00:16:41,850
Somebody!

258
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:43,970
Anybody!

259
00:16:44,330 --> 00:16:45,900
Come quickly!

260
00:16:46,690 --> 00:16:47,910
Senior.

261
00:16:47,930 --> 00:16:49,420
What's wrong with Master? Master!

262
00:16:49,420 --> 00:16:50,090
Master!

263
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:51,490
Master!

264
00:16:51,690 --> 00:16:52,300
Master.

265
00:16:52,570 --> 00:16:53,090
This...

266
00:16:53,180 --> 00:16:53,850
Master.

267
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:00,260
Senior.

268
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:02,730
Second Brother.

269
00:17:08,099 --> 00:17:08,940
Senior,

270
00:17:10,290 --> 00:17:12,329
trust that I'll avenge you.

271
00:17:13,619 --> 00:17:14,619
I promise.

272
00:17:20,250 --> 00:17:21,109
Eldest Master,

273
00:17:21,339 --> 00:17:22,800
those two have been let go.

274
00:17:23,210 --> 00:17:24,619
Send this news

275
00:17:24,819 --> 00:17:26,450
to the other Batous.

276
00:17:27,079 --> 00:17:28,560
Sect Master is dead.

277
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:31,630
The priority is to
set up the funeral altar.

278
00:17:34,380 --> 00:17:35,450
Tell everyone that

279
00:17:36,290 --> 00:17:37,450
whatever it is,

280
00:17:38,690 --> 00:17:40,050
we'll talk at the funeral.

281
00:17:40,050 --> 00:17:41,180
Yes, Eldest Master.

282
00:17:58,190 --> 00:18:00,210
[Honored Ancestor and Leader, Zhou Xingsi]

283
00:18:05,530 --> 00:18:06,530
Eldest Brother,

284
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:08,940
the time has come.

285
00:18:09,620 --> 00:18:10,480
Eldest Master,

286
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:12,620
Feiyan isn't here.

287
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:14,070
Let's wait for her.

288
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:14,940
Wait for her?

289
00:18:15,290 --> 00:18:18,400
She was the closest
to Shangguan Chengming.

290
00:18:18,730 --> 00:18:21,330
Sect Master is dead,
yet there is no sign of her.

291
00:18:21,450 --> 00:18:23,970
Do you still not realize

292
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:25,860
who killed Sect Master by now?

293
00:18:26,900 --> 00:18:28,760
Sect Master died an unjust death.

294
00:18:28,820 --> 00:18:31,530
Shouldn't we let him rest in peace first?

295
00:18:31,620 --> 00:18:33,420
The Chief Batou is right!

296
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:35,940
By the order of the founder,

297
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:39,250
the heroic soul of Zhou Xingsi,

298
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:41,540
the 24th Sect Master of Tianxiang Sect,

299
00:18:41,770 --> 00:18:43,630
returns to a divine place of rest!

300
00:18:44,450 --> 00:18:47,140
This soul is a loyal martyr of Tianxiang,

301
00:18:47,210 --> 00:18:48,730
with towering righteousness.

302
00:18:48,730 --> 00:18:52,010
May the Lord of the Underworld show mercy

303
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:54,140
and decree his swift reincarnation.

304
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:57,140
Gathering from
all across the land to mourn,

305
00:18:57,340 --> 00:19:00,820
we burn incense to honor our leader!

306
00:19:01,730 --> 00:19:03,590
Sect Master met such a cruel fate,

307
00:19:03,690 --> 00:19:06,350
yet Shangguan Chengming
is nowhere to be found.

308
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:09,110
What an absolute dishonor
to our Tianxiang Sect.

309
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:10,530
Today, we

310
00:19:10,970 --> 00:19:12,340
swear a blood oath to

311
00:19:12,970 --> 00:19:14,430
bring that evil scoundrel

312
00:19:14,970 --> 00:19:16,250
back to the sect!

313
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,480
To the disloyal and treacherous...

314
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:26,740
-behold this lotus!
-Behold this lotus!

315
00:19:33,010 --> 00:19:35,770
I was with Sect Master the longest.

316
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:38,580
And you're next after me, right?

317
00:19:40,180 --> 00:19:42,140
Say, were we blind

318
00:19:42,140 --> 00:19:44,210
or just completely stupid

319
00:19:44,210 --> 00:19:46,250
to ever trust Shangguan Chengming?

320
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:49,310
He was Sect Master's blessing
in his later years.

321
00:19:49,990 --> 00:19:51,270
At that age,

322
00:19:52,250 --> 00:19:54,140
who wouldn't hope for a son?

323
00:19:54,180 --> 00:19:55,260
That's true.

324
00:19:58,420 --> 00:19:59,750
I heard that some people

325
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:03,040
in the sect have been wanting
to flip the tables for a while.

326
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:05,970
It's just a few unseasoned punks

327
00:20:05,970 --> 00:20:07,490
wagging their tongues.

328
00:20:09,490 --> 00:20:10,970
Your loyalty to Sect Master

329
00:20:10,970 --> 00:20:13,100
is obvious to all.

330
00:20:13,290 --> 00:20:14,450
I just want

331
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,720
to lead a simple

332
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,380
and peaceful life.

333
00:20:19,050 --> 00:20:20,100
I don't want

334
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:21,580
anything else.

335
00:20:21,580 --> 00:20:23,140
A peaceful life is good.

336
00:20:23,770 --> 00:20:25,580
I want a peaceful life too.

337
00:20:26,660 --> 00:20:27,490
But

338
00:20:27,620 --> 00:20:29,240
Sect Master put so much effort

339
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:31,120
into establishing this foundation,

340
00:20:31,120 --> 00:20:32,840
only to leave just like that.

341
00:20:33,380 --> 00:20:34,140
I...

342
00:20:34,970 --> 00:20:36,490
As his junior,

343
00:20:36,530 --> 00:20:38,770
shouldn't I protect the empire he built

344
00:20:39,420 --> 00:20:41,900
even if it costs me my life?

345
00:20:46,040 --> 00:20:46,900
Eldest Master,

346
00:20:47,940 --> 00:20:49,380
I'm not good with subtleties.

347
00:20:49,380 --> 00:20:50,530
Just give it

348
00:20:50,970 --> 00:20:51,970
to me straight.

349
00:20:51,970 --> 00:20:52,660
Alright.

350
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:57,120
Fill Second Master's cup.

351
00:21:03,270 --> 00:21:04,180
Huaiyi,

352
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:06,690
there are some things I can't spell out

353
00:21:06,820 --> 00:21:08,210
in the ancestral hall.

354
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:10,940
I know you like Feiyan.

355
00:21:11,420 --> 00:21:14,340
But at a critical moment like this,

356
00:21:14,770 --> 00:21:15,820
I advise you

357
00:21:16,530 --> 00:21:19,090
to keep your hands clean.

358
00:21:37,210 --> 00:21:38,730
I can't believe

359
00:21:39,340 --> 00:21:41,210
Shangguan Chengming

360
00:21:41,210 --> 00:21:43,250
really killed Sect Master.

361
00:21:44,210 --> 00:21:45,620
You think it was him too?

362
00:21:45,730 --> 00:21:47,100
To prevent Sect Master

363
00:21:47,210 --> 00:21:49,900
from killing his mentor,

364
00:21:50,490 --> 00:21:52,770
that hypocrite struck first

365
00:21:52,900 --> 00:21:54,230
to kill the Sect Master,

366
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:56,900
and then fled.

367
00:21:57,250 --> 00:21:58,530
There's no way

368
00:21:59,690 --> 00:22:01,900
Shangguan Chengming is the killer.

369
00:22:04,450 --> 00:22:05,530
It's not him?

370
00:22:06,970 --> 00:22:08,210
If not him,

371
00:22:08,490 --> 00:22:09,490
who else could it be?

372
00:22:09,490 --> 00:22:10,420
Think about it.

373
00:22:10,490 --> 00:22:12,150
The killer struck right after

374
00:22:12,340 --> 00:22:13,730
Zhang Dancheng returned.

375
00:22:13,730 --> 00:22:16,860
Isn't it obvious they're framing
Shangguan Chengming?

376
00:22:18,210 --> 00:22:19,340
This person

377
00:22:20,620 --> 00:22:21,900
was too impatient.

378
00:22:22,580 --> 00:22:24,340
The mantis stalks the cicada,

379
00:22:25,180 --> 00:22:26,840
unaware of the oriole behind.

380
00:22:27,180 --> 00:22:28,490
Now,

381
00:22:28,490 --> 00:22:31,140
I see mantises and cicadas everywhere,

382
00:22:31,420 --> 00:22:34,210
but the oriole is nowhere to be found.

383
00:22:34,620 --> 00:22:37,500
Chief Batou ordered
Shangguan Chengming's arrest.

384
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:39,730
We're not getting involved in this mess,

385
00:22:39,730 --> 00:22:41,450
lest we get blindsided

386
00:22:41,620 --> 00:22:42,660
by the oriole.

387
00:22:43,100 --> 00:22:44,660
From the looks of it,

388
00:22:45,290 --> 00:22:47,970
someone is trying to revolt.

389
00:22:49,100 --> 00:22:50,050
Third Brother,

390
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:53,570
who do you think it could be?

391
00:22:56,210 --> 00:22:58,580
Second Brother isn't ambitious.

392
00:22:58,730 --> 00:23:00,050
He just wants a peaceful end.

393
00:23:00,050 --> 00:23:01,660
He wouldn't do such a thing.

394
00:23:02,050 --> 00:23:04,140
Fourth Brother thinks he's above it all,

395
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:05,800
so it definitely can't be him.

396
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:06,860
Could it be...

397
00:23:07,970 --> 00:23:09,010
Eldest Brother?

398
00:23:10,970 --> 00:23:11,770
Qin Baichuan?

399
00:23:12,450 --> 00:23:14,860
He's been in Suhang for a long time,

400
00:23:15,010 --> 00:23:18,180
so there's little news of him.

401
00:23:18,180 --> 00:23:19,530
I wouldn't even know

402
00:23:19,820 --> 00:23:21,220
where to begin guessing.

403
00:23:22,620 --> 00:23:26,730
Then who do you think
we should side with this time?

404
00:23:28,380 --> 00:23:29,380
Side with whom?

405
00:23:29,380 --> 00:23:31,690
At a time like this,
we brothers should just

406
00:23:31,690 --> 00:23:34,350
sit on the fence and see
which way the wind blows.

407
00:23:34,490 --> 00:23:36,290
Whichever way the wind blows...

408
00:23:36,730 --> 00:23:38,380
The grass bends.

409
00:23:40,250 --> 00:23:41,180
Third Brother.

410
00:23:42,620 --> 00:23:43,620
Second Master,

411
00:23:43,770 --> 00:23:46,210
I know you want a peaceful life now

412
00:23:46,700 --> 00:23:48,900
and no longer wish to live by swindling.

413
00:23:49,010 --> 00:23:50,810
But now that Sect Master is dead,

414
00:23:51,100 --> 00:23:53,940
do you think the sect will know peace?

415
00:23:57,340 --> 00:23:58,010
Someone

416
00:23:58,620 --> 00:24:00,620
set a trap for Shangguan Chengming.

417
00:24:00,940 --> 00:24:01,860
He won't

418
00:24:02,620 --> 00:24:03,880
get out of this easily.

419
00:24:04,380 --> 00:24:05,380
You came to me

420
00:24:06,940 --> 00:24:08,730
instead of going to mourn

421
00:24:09,290 --> 00:24:10,250
Sect Master.

422
00:24:11,580 --> 00:24:13,440
You want me to help him, don't you?

423
00:24:13,450 --> 00:24:14,380
Second Brother,

424
00:24:15,050 --> 00:24:16,320
in the entire sect,

425
00:24:17,530 --> 00:24:19,660
you were the most loyal to Sect Master.

426
00:24:19,770 --> 00:24:21,970
But his death is shrouded

427
00:24:22,140 --> 00:24:23,140
in mystery.

428
00:24:23,290 --> 00:24:24,530
You and I

429
00:24:25,250 --> 00:24:26,620
can't just let it go.

430
00:24:30,380 --> 00:24:32,250
Just take care of yourself.

431
00:24:32,660 --> 00:24:34,210
I just hope you can

432
00:24:34,490 --> 00:24:35,490
fly higher

433
00:24:36,860 --> 00:24:37,770
and further.

434
00:24:45,940 --> 00:24:46,660
Mentor,

435
00:24:47,210 --> 00:24:48,530
I've bought your ticket

436
00:24:48,530 --> 00:24:49,900
to Pangzhou.

437
00:24:50,820 --> 00:24:52,220
At this stage of the plan,

438
00:24:52,320 --> 00:24:53,320
you can

439
00:24:54,140 --> 00:24:55,450
leave the rest to me.

440
00:24:59,970 --> 00:25:02,970
The 36 revolutions of the Kan and Li;
yet there remains

441
00:25:03,340 --> 00:25:06,140
the meeting of the Dragon and Tiger
in the dantian.

442
00:25:07,580 --> 00:25:09,530
This is the final hurdle.

443
00:25:09,920 --> 00:25:11,850
Whether you can cross it

444
00:25:11,890 --> 00:25:13,530
is in the hands of destiny.

445
00:25:13,560 --> 00:25:14,670
Don't worry.

446
00:25:15,620 --> 00:25:17,050
I've dug the graves for

447
00:25:17,900 --> 00:25:18,960
the remaining few.

448
00:25:19,010 --> 00:25:20,380
As your mentor,

449
00:25:20,970 --> 00:25:23,250
I've taught you everything I know.

450
00:25:26,100 --> 00:25:27,490
I'm getting old.

451
00:25:28,180 --> 00:25:29,580
All I see

452
00:25:30,140 --> 00:25:31,730
are old grudges.

453
00:25:31,970 --> 00:25:33,660
But you can see very far.

454
00:25:34,380 --> 00:25:35,450
Right now,

455
00:25:35,580 --> 00:25:38,310
I just want Tianxiang Sect
wiped from this world.

456
00:25:38,620 --> 00:25:40,250
I don't want anyone else...

457
00:25:41,710 --> 00:25:43,770
to get caught up in grudges like mine.

458
00:25:53,770 --> 00:25:54,620
Mentor.

459
00:26:43,660 --> 00:26:44,690
Please come in.

460
00:26:45,090 --> 00:26:46,780
[Chunfeng House]

461
00:26:53,770 --> 00:26:54,380
Come in.

462
00:27:00,350 --> 00:27:01,620
You sure are bold to

463
00:27:01,970 --> 00:27:03,300
run around when they are

464
00:27:03,490 --> 00:27:04,380
hunting you down.

465
00:27:04,380 --> 00:27:05,710
Now the sect is in chaos,

466
00:27:05,820 --> 00:27:07,210
with Qin Baichuan in charge.

467
00:27:07,210 --> 00:27:09,210
His ambition is no secret to anyone.

468
00:27:09,940 --> 00:27:11,210
So what's your plan?

469
00:27:12,660 --> 00:27:14,390
I've got my eye on a scam target.

470
00:27:14,530 --> 00:27:15,420
He has the

471
00:27:15,420 --> 00:27:17,340
inside information
on Qin Baichuan's rebellion.

472
00:27:17,340 --> 00:27:18,450
Do me a favor.

473
00:27:18,770 --> 00:27:19,490
Go find him

474
00:27:20,020 --> 00:27:21,450
and get the evidence.

475
00:27:22,860 --> 00:27:24,860
Here are the address and the ticket.

476
00:27:30,190 --> 00:27:32,680
[13 Wanping Road, Qiu Mansion, Pujiang]

477
00:27:33,340 --> 00:27:34,100
Pujiang.

478
00:27:35,340 --> 00:27:36,340
That's quite far.

479
00:27:38,340 --> 00:27:39,250
What about you?

480
00:27:39,490 --> 00:27:40,970
Staying here all alone,

481
00:27:41,940 --> 00:27:43,470
what are you planning to do?

482
00:27:44,420 --> 00:27:45,140
I'll be—

483
00:27:45,140 --> 00:27:47,000
They're hunting you everywhere.

484
00:27:47,380 --> 00:27:48,530
How about this?

485
00:27:49,210 --> 00:27:50,210
You go find him.

486
00:27:50,490 --> 00:27:51,620
It's a good chance

487
00:27:52,770 --> 00:27:53,860
to lay low.

488
00:27:53,990 --> 00:27:56,450
To take this throne,
you're the first person

489
00:27:57,030 --> 00:27:58,900
Qin Baichuan will try to eliminate.

490
00:27:58,900 --> 00:28:00,900
You're the chief of Yuehaitang Branch,

491
00:28:00,900 --> 00:28:02,900
which makes you his biggest threat.

492
00:28:03,730 --> 00:28:05,590
It's not safe for you to stay here.

493
00:28:11,760 --> 00:28:13,020
Shangguan Chengming,

494
00:28:14,670 --> 00:28:16,930
so you're sending me away because you are

495
00:28:17,850 --> 00:28:19,250
worried about my safety.

496
00:28:19,940 --> 00:28:21,860
Then you can stay behind alone

497
00:28:22,580 --> 00:28:24,180
and fight them all.

498
00:28:25,210 --> 00:28:25,970
Right?

499
00:28:32,370 --> 00:28:33,450
As you know...

500
00:28:35,140 --> 00:28:37,270
until Tianxiang Sect is annihilated,

501
00:28:38,510 --> 00:28:39,800
I'm staying right here—

502
00:28:39,410 --> 00:28:42,730
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

503
00:28:42,750 --> 00:28:45,640
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

504
00:28:46,250 --> 00:28:49,770
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

505
00:28:49,800 --> 00:28:52,640
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

506
00:28:53,220 --> 00:28:56,840
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

507
00:28:56,870 --> 00:28:59,690
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

508
00:29:00,460 --> 00:29:03,590
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

509
00:29:03,610 --> 00:29:08,010
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

510
00:29:11,770 --> 00:29:13,140
You said it yourself:

511
00:29:13,970 --> 00:29:16,170
If you fear death,
go home and rear pigs.

512
00:30:09,660 --> 00:30:11,010
Since everyone is here,

513
00:30:11,330 --> 00:30:14,290
we must allow Sect Master to
rest in peace today.

514
00:30:15,940 --> 00:30:16,800
Eldest Master,

515
00:30:17,250 --> 00:30:18,290
don't you agree?

516
00:30:18,940 --> 00:30:20,800
You're very thoughtful, Feiyan.

517
00:30:20,970 --> 00:30:21,730
Now,

518
00:30:22,210 --> 00:30:24,100
bring Shangguan Chengming in!

519
00:30:32,290 --> 00:30:33,090
Jiang Feiyan,

520
00:30:33,490 --> 00:30:34,900
you captured him.

521
00:30:35,990 --> 00:30:37,710
The credit goes to you.

522
00:30:37,740 --> 00:30:39,350
But it's not your place

523
00:30:39,420 --> 00:30:41,020
to speak here.

524
00:30:41,210 --> 00:30:42,050
Men,

525
00:30:42,290 --> 00:30:43,720
drag him out and execute him!

526
00:30:43,720 --> 00:30:45,850
Let's see who dares to lay a hand on him!

527
00:30:46,250 --> 00:30:47,510
Since when does a woman

528
00:30:47,900 --> 00:30:49,900
call the shots in Tianxiang Sect?

529
00:30:49,930 --> 00:30:52,620
Tianxiang Sect has abandoned
the fight for justice.

530
00:30:52,620 --> 00:30:54,680
Does it matter if a woman is in charge?

531
00:30:55,180 --> 00:30:56,110
Starting today,

532
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:57,730
whoever is most capable

533
00:30:57,840 --> 00:30:59,430
will rule Tianxiang Sect!

534
00:31:01,530 --> 00:31:02,690
So you want to be

535
00:31:03,050 --> 00:31:04,920
the new sect master?

536
00:31:05,050 --> 00:31:06,110
You got that right.

537
00:31:06,770 --> 00:31:08,660
I want to be the sect master

538
00:31:08,860 --> 00:31:10,320
and establish my own sect.

539
00:31:24,660 --> 00:31:25,490
Come clean.

540
00:31:25,770 --> 00:31:26,730
Who ordered you

541
00:31:27,530 --> 00:31:29,050
to kill Sect Master?

542
00:31:32,490 --> 00:31:33,140
Answer me!

543
00:31:34,100 --> 00:31:36,300
Since you're throwing me under the bus,

544
00:31:37,100 --> 00:31:38,660
I'll spill everything.

545
00:31:39,970 --> 00:31:40,570
It was him,

546
00:31:40,620 --> 00:31:41,450
Qin Baichuan.

547
00:31:41,620 --> 00:31:43,490
He wanted me to pose as Sect Master's son

548
00:31:43,490 --> 00:31:44,550
to get close to him,

549
00:31:44,660 --> 00:31:46,490
gain his absolute trust, and then strike

550
00:31:46,490 --> 00:31:47,950
when the moment was right!

551
00:31:51,820 --> 00:31:53,100
Shangguan Chengming,

552
00:31:53,210 --> 00:31:55,340
you're quite the strategist, huh?

553
00:31:56,010 --> 00:31:58,450
It wasn't me who wanted Sect Master dead

554
00:31:58,450 --> 00:32:00,730
but you and Jiang Feiyan!

555
00:32:02,140 --> 00:32:03,250
In 1928,

556
00:32:03,580 --> 00:32:04,730
Wang Jiaxian

557
00:32:05,100 --> 00:32:06,030
and Jiang Feiyan

558
00:32:06,380 --> 00:32:07,660
tied the knot.

559
00:32:08,010 --> 00:32:08,970
I found this

560
00:32:09,100 --> 00:32:11,420
from your hometown, Jianghuai.

561
00:32:11,530 --> 00:32:12,450
One of you

562
00:32:12,660 --> 00:32:14,520
pretended to be Sect Master's son

563
00:32:14,660 --> 00:32:15,660
to poison him,

564
00:32:15,660 --> 00:32:17,050
while the other covered it up

565
00:32:17,050 --> 00:32:18,580
and joined the scam.

566
00:32:18,730 --> 00:32:20,860
You haven't even wiped your own asses,

567
00:32:20,940 --> 00:32:23,870
and you're trying to
dump your feces on someone else?

568
00:32:24,050 --> 00:32:24,900
Everyone,

569
00:32:25,050 --> 00:32:26,490
what is the punishment

570
00:32:26,690 --> 00:32:27,970
for treachery?

571
00:32:27,970 --> 00:32:29,050
Human oil candle!

572
00:32:29,050 --> 00:32:30,420
Yes, human oil candle!

573
00:32:30,770 --> 00:32:33,860
Arrest Jiang Feiyan and Wang Jiaxian!

574
00:32:33,860 --> 00:32:35,280
Treachery does warrant

575
00:32:36,350 --> 00:32:37,900
the human oil candle punishment.

576
00:32:37,900 --> 00:32:39,660
But it's still uncertain

577
00:32:40,180 --> 00:32:41,510
who the real traitor is.

578
00:32:42,210 --> 00:32:44,140
I have a piece of evidence here too.

579
00:32:44,300 --> 00:32:45,610
Will you read it...

580
00:32:48,050 --> 00:32:49,290
or will your son,

581
00:32:49,940 --> 00:32:51,210
Qin Huiming, read it?

582
00:32:55,690 --> 00:32:56,290
Go,

583
00:32:56,490 --> 00:32:58,080
get us brothers another pot of wine.

584
00:32:58,080 --> 00:32:59,210
Yes, Eldest Master.

585
00:33:13,210 --> 00:33:13,820
How was it?

586
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:16,830
I eavesdropped outside the window
for a long time,

587
00:33:16,830 --> 00:33:18,420
but I heard nothing unusual.

588
00:33:18,420 --> 00:33:20,690
They talked about protecting
Sect Master's empire,

589
00:33:20,690 --> 00:33:22,070
and Qin Baichuan told Second Master

590
00:33:22,070 --> 00:33:22,790
to stay away

591
00:33:22,820 --> 00:33:23,770
from Fifth Batou.

592
00:33:23,770 --> 00:33:25,370
Qin Baichuan is threatening

593
00:33:25,530 --> 00:33:26,730
Second Batou into

594
00:33:26,730 --> 00:33:28,010
handing over Jiang Feiyan.

595
00:33:28,010 --> 00:33:29,940
So he's the one who wants to revolt.

596
00:33:30,210 --> 00:33:31,140
He bided his time

597
00:33:31,180 --> 00:33:32,400
and finally got the chance.

598
00:33:32,400 --> 00:33:34,290
Qin Baichuan wants to
pull Second Batou to his side.

599
00:33:34,290 --> 00:33:36,210
Then they're about to make a move.

600
00:33:36,450 --> 00:33:38,820
Second Batou might not necessarily
join his sinking ship.

601
00:33:38,820 --> 00:33:39,650
But I bet

602
00:33:40,100 --> 00:33:41,600
Qin Baichuan has a backup plan.

603
00:33:41,600 --> 00:33:43,200
During their conversation,

604
00:33:43,230 --> 00:33:45,000
a gofer was there the whole time.

605
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:45,940
Why wasn't Qin Baichuan

606
00:33:45,940 --> 00:33:48,380
worried about the gofer
hearing such secrets?

607
00:33:48,380 --> 00:33:51,090
Qin Baichuan probably
wanted the gofer to hear it.

608
00:33:51,090 --> 00:33:52,220
Where's that gofer?

609
00:34:02,690 --> 00:34:03,750
It's been forever,

610
00:34:03,820 --> 00:34:05,050
and still, nobody has

611
00:34:05,050 --> 00:34:06,310
touched base with him.

612
00:34:06,530 --> 00:34:07,450
How about I just

613
00:34:08,780 --> 00:34:09,580
grab him here?

614
00:34:09,610 --> 00:34:10,340
A few punches

615
00:34:10,489 --> 00:34:11,350
and he'll talk.

616
00:34:12,340 --> 00:34:13,540
Catching him is easy.

617
00:34:13,630 --> 00:34:14,739
If Qin Baichuan

618
00:34:14,739 --> 00:34:16,350
secures proof of our rebellion,

619
00:34:16,350 --> 00:34:17,659
we're dead either way.

620
00:34:18,820 --> 00:34:19,420
Why are

621
00:34:19,420 --> 00:34:21,750
the mosquitoes only biting me and not you?

622
00:34:28,610 --> 00:34:29,570
I'll follow him.

623
00:34:29,670 --> 00:34:30,429
You go to the river

624
00:34:30,429 --> 00:34:32,300
and see if he left anything behind.

625
00:34:32,300 --> 00:34:33,449
Stay put. I'll go.

626
00:34:33,780 --> 00:34:35,420
If his contact shows up,

627
00:34:35,699 --> 00:34:37,300
I can handle them.

628
00:34:37,820 --> 00:34:38,489
Okay.

629
00:35:30,170 --> 00:35:31,130
Brothers,

630
00:35:31,380 --> 00:35:32,510
Sect Master is dead.

631
00:35:33,090 --> 00:35:34,450
Before the funeral altar,

632
00:35:34,450 --> 00:35:35,940
burning incense is the signal.

633
00:35:35,940 --> 00:35:37,480
Raise the banner of justice,

634
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:39,010
revolt, and seize the sect.

635
00:35:39,220 --> 00:35:40,530
From Qin Huiming.

636
00:35:41,220 --> 00:35:42,080
Eldest Master,

637
00:35:42,120 --> 00:35:44,760
you're truly blessed in this life.

638
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:46,160
You actually have a son.

639
00:35:46,450 --> 00:35:48,110
Why didn't you tell everyone?

640
00:35:51,240 --> 00:35:53,880
Do you think you can sling mud

641
00:35:54,340 --> 00:35:55,780
with a fake letter?

642
00:35:55,800 --> 00:35:57,660
How is it that your photos are real

643
00:35:58,010 --> 00:35:59,490
but my evidence is fake?

644
00:35:59,600 --> 00:36:00,470
Besides,

645
00:36:00,820 --> 00:36:02,170
he is right here.

646
00:36:03,700 --> 00:36:04,830
We'll know the truth

647
00:36:05,100 --> 00:36:06,480
once we test it.

648
00:36:08,860 --> 00:36:09,570
Enough!

649
00:36:10,260 --> 00:36:11,470
Shangguan Chengming,

650
00:36:11,470 --> 00:36:12,740
you deceived Sixth Batou,

651
00:36:12,740 --> 00:36:13,700
killed Sect Master,

652
00:36:13,700 --> 00:36:15,260
and dragged Feiyan into danger with you.

653
00:36:15,260 --> 00:36:16,420
Isn't that enough?

654
00:36:16,530 --> 00:36:17,740
Now you're here falsely

655
00:36:17,740 --> 00:36:18,970
accusing Chief Batou!

656
00:36:18,970 --> 00:36:19,830
Second Master,

657
00:36:19,860 --> 00:36:21,630
you've followed Sect Master for so long.

658
00:36:21,630 --> 00:36:23,710
You wouldn't want him to roll over

659
00:36:24,260 --> 00:36:25,590
in his grave, would you?

660
00:36:27,570 --> 00:36:28,450
Eldest Master,

661
00:36:28,700 --> 00:36:29,780
it's simple.

662
00:36:31,050 --> 00:36:32,580
Trade this gofer's life...

663
00:36:34,420 --> 00:36:35,820
to prove your innocence.

664
00:36:41,850 --> 00:36:42,710
Eldest Master.

665
00:36:47,300 --> 00:36:47,650
Okay,

666
00:36:48,340 --> 00:36:49,140
I'll help you.

667
00:36:52,610 --> 00:36:53,940
He is my son!

668
00:36:54,340 --> 00:36:55,090
I'm...

669
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:57,110
I'm revolting today!

670
00:37:00,090 --> 00:37:01,750
I've already deployed my men.

671
00:37:02,170 --> 00:37:03,940
Zhou is already dead!

672
00:37:04,130 --> 00:37:05,660
The position of Sect Master

673
00:37:06,130 --> 00:37:08,270
belongs to me, Qin Baichuan!

674
00:37:08,300 --> 00:37:09,160
Eldest Master!

675
00:37:10,020 --> 00:37:11,830
Freeze! Drop your knives!

676
00:37:11,860 --> 00:37:15,010
Freeze! Drop your knives!

677
00:37:16,340 --> 00:37:17,900
Where did you come from?

678
00:37:23,960 --> 00:37:25,850
The men you placed in ambush

679
00:37:26,780 --> 00:37:27,980
outside the city were

680
00:37:28,170 --> 00:37:29,340
all wiped out by me.

681
00:37:29,420 --> 00:37:29,970
You...

682
00:37:31,220 --> 00:37:32,300
Interesting.

683
00:37:50,500 --> 00:37:51,540
How interesting.

684
00:37:52,230 --> 00:37:54,430
I've attended many funerals in my life,

685
00:37:55,340 --> 00:37:57,450
but attending my own

686
00:37:57,640 --> 00:37:59,110
is a first.

687
00:38:02,380 --> 00:38:04,700
Quick, go brew some alum soup

688
00:38:05,120 --> 00:38:05,970
to detoxify me.

689
00:38:05,970 --> 00:38:07,090
Careful, Master.

690
00:38:07,610 --> 00:38:08,700
I'll go right away.

691
00:38:40,680 --> 00:38:41,590
You're here.

692
00:38:42,160 --> 00:38:43,030
Yes, I'm here.

693
00:38:47,650 --> 00:38:50,360
What are all those people
waiting for outside?

694
00:38:51,270 --> 00:38:52,540
Waiting for me to die.

695
00:39:01,700 --> 00:39:02,490
Come on.

696
00:39:03,490 --> 00:39:05,490
You've worked hard all these years.

697
00:39:06,560 --> 00:39:08,370
Let me pour you a cup of tea.

698
00:39:11,250 --> 00:39:12,310
Thank you, Master.

699
00:39:12,410 --> 00:39:13,220
Drink up.

700
00:39:21,300 --> 00:39:22,760
Is your family doing well?

701
00:39:22,780 --> 00:39:23,450
Yes,

702
00:39:23,650 --> 00:39:24,490
they're good.

703
00:39:25,610 --> 00:39:27,570
I know you have 3 kids.

704
00:39:27,620 --> 00:39:28,650
Are your finances okay?

705
00:39:28,650 --> 00:39:29,380
Yes,

706
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:31,060
you've always been generous.

707
00:39:33,220 --> 00:39:34,860
When things ease up,

708
00:39:35,860 --> 00:39:36,860
take a trip home.

709
00:39:36,940 --> 00:39:39,820
Spend some quality time
with your wife and kids.

710
00:39:40,020 --> 00:39:42,170
It's been a while
since you went back, right?

711
00:39:42,170 --> 00:39:43,230
Thank you, Master.

712
00:39:45,160 --> 00:39:46,360
Over the years...

713
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:07,760
Don't worry.

714
00:40:08,090 --> 00:40:10,070
I'll take good care
of your family for you.

715
00:40:10,070 --> 00:40:11,520
No one can leave the premises

716
00:40:11,520 --> 00:40:13,290
until Sect Master comes out.

717
00:40:15,910 --> 00:40:16,790
Senior?

718
00:40:17,610 --> 00:40:18,420
Senior?

719
00:40:18,900 --> 00:40:19,650
Senior!

720
00:40:20,300 --> 00:40:21,630
Somebody come quickly!

721
00:40:22,170 --> 00:40:22,700
Senior?

722
00:40:22,860 --> 00:40:23,420
Senior!

723
00:40:23,700 --> 00:40:24,610
What happened to Sect Master?

724
00:40:24,610 --> 00:40:24,940
Sect Master!

725
00:40:24,940 --> 00:40:25,420
Master!

726
00:40:25,940 --> 00:40:27,170
Master!

727
00:40:27,700 --> 00:40:28,450
Senior,

728
00:40:28,900 --> 00:40:30,700
trust that I'll avenge you.

729
00:40:31,170 --> 00:40:32,220
I promise.

730
00:40:37,530 --> 00:40:38,010
S-Sect...

731
00:40:38,010 --> 00:40:38,740
Sect Master?

732
00:40:40,340 --> 00:40:41,220
Qin,

733
00:40:42,780 --> 00:40:44,450
if you want my throne,

734
00:40:44,680 --> 00:40:46,030
just say it.

735
00:40:46,300 --> 00:40:47,560
Why go to such lengths?

736
00:40:49,250 --> 00:40:51,330
You knew he was Wang Jiaxian,

737
00:40:51,530 --> 00:40:52,300
but you kept mum,

738
00:40:52,300 --> 00:40:54,260
so as to use him to do your dirty work.

739
00:40:54,260 --> 00:40:55,300
Director Wang,

740
00:40:55,910 --> 00:40:58,200
what punishment does this call for?

741
00:40:58,410 --> 00:41:00,820
The father and son,
Qin Baichuan and Qin Huiming,

742
00:41:00,820 --> 00:41:03,430
defrauded the people
and committed murder for money.

743
00:41:03,430 --> 00:41:04,840
They deserve to die.

744
00:41:05,650 --> 00:41:06,510
Death penalty.

745
00:41:06,780 --> 00:41:07,700
Execute them on the spot.

746
00:41:07,700 --> 00:41:08,060
Take them away!

747
00:41:08,060 --> 00:41:08,830
Wait.

748
00:41:09,520 --> 00:41:11,480
Let me say one thing before you go.

749
00:41:14,610 --> 00:41:15,700
As things stand,

750
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:18,390
this is where we part ways, my brother.

751
00:41:19,050 --> 00:41:21,110
There's nothing else I can do for you.

752
00:41:21,720 --> 00:41:22,520
Tell you what,

753
00:41:23,070 --> 00:41:25,550
I'll pay for the bullets to execute you.

754
00:41:27,460 --> 00:41:28,340
Director Wang,

755
00:41:28,780 --> 00:41:30,040
buy a few more bullets.

756
00:41:30,340 --> 00:41:31,340
That's a lot.

757
00:41:32,970 --> 00:41:33,640
Take him away.

758
00:41:33,640 --> 00:41:34,840
You old fox!

759
00:41:35,090 --> 00:41:36,470
You'll meet a dreadful end!

760
00:41:36,470 --> 00:41:38,200
I'll haunt you from the grave!

761
00:41:38,380 --> 00:41:39,450
You old fox!

762
00:41:39,610 --> 00:41:41,380
You'll die a horrible death!

763
00:41:41,700 --> 00:41:42,560
Director Wang,

764
00:41:42,570 --> 00:41:43,700
since you're here,

765
00:41:43,700 --> 00:41:45,360
have a cup of tea before you go.

766
00:41:45,360 --> 00:41:47,160
I have official business to handle,

767
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:48,280
so I won't stay.

768
00:41:48,530 --> 00:41:50,370
Let's catch up another day.

769
00:41:50,400 --> 00:41:51,350
Another day.

770
00:41:55,490 --> 00:41:56,380
Just one shot?

771
00:41:57,490 --> 00:41:58,420
Give it a second.

772
00:42:00,420 --> 00:42:01,170
Satisfying.

773
00:42:01,340 --> 00:42:01,970
All done.

774
00:42:02,450 --> 00:42:03,130
Thank you.

775
00:42:03,580 --> 00:42:04,640
I'll take my leave.

776
00:42:15,530 --> 00:42:17,610
Wang Jiaxian,

777
00:42:17,970 --> 00:42:19,010
right?

778
00:42:19,420 --> 00:42:20,300
I set the scene

779
00:42:20,300 --> 00:42:21,650
perfectly for you.

780
00:42:22,650 --> 00:42:24,780
How did you mess it up like this?

781
00:42:26,170 --> 00:42:27,370
I'll get to the point.

782
00:42:27,610 --> 00:42:29,090
Tomorrow at Yunhe Temple,

783
00:42:29,170 --> 00:42:31,450
Wang Jiaxian and Jiang Feiyan
will be subjected to

784
00:42:31,450 --> 00:42:32,900
the human oil candle punishment.

785
00:42:32,900 --> 00:42:34,050
Do it the old way,

786
00:42:34,300 --> 00:42:36,010
full scale and by the book.

787
00:42:43,160 --> 00:42:45,010
You guys, keep a close eye on them.

788
00:42:45,010 --> 00:42:45,860
Yes!

789
00:42:47,490 --> 00:42:49,940
Shangguan Chengming and Jiang Feiyan

790
00:42:50,130 --> 00:42:51,740
both played themselves.

791
00:42:52,090 --> 00:42:53,420
What a ruthless move

792
00:42:53,860 --> 00:42:54,940
from Sect Master.

793
00:42:55,220 --> 00:42:56,820
By feigning dead,

794
00:42:57,010 --> 00:42:59,410
he not only rooted out these two traitors,

795
00:42:59,650 --> 00:43:01,740
but even got rid of Qin Baichuan,

796
00:43:01,740 --> 00:43:03,270
the long-standing threat.

797
00:43:04,010 --> 00:43:04,740
Brilliant.

798
00:43:06,010 --> 00:43:07,340
Absolutely brilliant.

799
00:43:07,940 --> 00:43:08,970
Third Brother,

800
00:43:09,940 --> 00:43:11,450
now only Second Brother

801
00:43:11,610 --> 00:43:12,820
is above you.

802
00:43:13,530 --> 00:43:14,490
And Sect Master

803
00:43:14,650 --> 00:43:15,860
told us to handle

804
00:43:15,860 --> 00:43:18,090
the human oil candle punishment well.

805
00:43:18,170 --> 00:43:19,030
Why do you think

806
00:43:19,700 --> 00:43:20,700
that is?

807
00:43:25,700 --> 00:43:27,220
Sect Master has run out of

808
00:43:27,450 --> 00:43:29,180
competent people he can trust.

809
00:43:29,530 --> 00:43:31,700
Our chance has come.

810
00:43:44,700 --> 00:43:45,700
Have some tea.

811
00:43:50,820 --> 00:43:51,380
Master,

812
00:43:51,530 --> 00:43:53,260
you raised Feiyan yourself.

813
00:43:53,650 --> 00:43:55,850
She's basically half a daughter to you.

814
00:43:56,170 --> 00:43:57,650
Please spare her life.

815
00:43:57,860 --> 00:43:58,940
The tea is cold.

816
00:43:59,420 --> 00:44:00,880
Go get some boiling water.

817
00:44:04,050 --> 00:44:04,700
Master,

818
00:44:05,010 --> 00:44:06,010
Feiyan has worked

819
00:44:06,130 --> 00:44:08,300
tirelessly for the sect all these years.

820
00:44:08,300 --> 00:44:10,340
Her efforts alone deserve credit.

821
00:44:10,570 --> 00:44:12,830
Think of how much money she's made for us.

822
00:44:12,940 --> 00:44:14,130
It's not worth

823
00:44:14,380 --> 00:44:15,780
losing one of our Batous

824
00:44:17,300 --> 00:44:18,700
over that punk, Master!

825
00:44:25,220 --> 00:44:27,450
I know you have a soft spot for her

826
00:44:28,530 --> 00:44:30,130
and can't bear to see her die.

827
00:44:30,220 --> 00:44:31,860
I don't have the heart to either.

828
00:44:31,860 --> 00:44:33,450
I want to spare her too,

829
00:44:33,900 --> 00:44:36,380
but the rules are the rules.

830
00:44:43,420 --> 00:44:44,220
I understand.

831
00:44:46,470 --> 00:44:47,800
A life for a life.

832
00:44:49,490 --> 00:44:50,900
What's with this act now?

833
00:44:51,000 --> 00:44:52,740
I think you've watched too many plays,
trying to be

834
00:44:52,740 --> 00:44:53,790
the knight in shining armor.

835
00:44:53,790 --> 00:44:54,780
Listen up.

836
00:44:55,380 --> 00:44:56,420
Those stories are

837
00:44:56,450 --> 00:44:59,010
made up by actors to sell tickets.

838
00:44:59,220 --> 00:45:00,620
Those are performances!

839
00:45:00,900 --> 00:45:02,530
Life only begins after

840
00:45:02,860 --> 00:45:04,260
you step off the stage.

841
00:45:04,420 --> 00:45:06,100
Feiyan's time is up.

842
00:45:06,130 --> 00:45:07,450
She must die.

843
00:45:07,450 --> 00:45:08,780
It's not a decision I made.

844
00:45:08,780 --> 00:45:10,860
It's arranged by heaven.

845
00:45:12,170 --> 00:45:13,420
You want to help her?

846
00:45:14,420 --> 00:45:15,380
Fine.

847
00:45:21,050 --> 00:45:22,580
Make your strike accurate.

848
00:45:22,940 --> 00:45:24,450
Give her a quick end

849
00:45:24,940 --> 00:45:26,780
so she suffers less.

850
00:45:28,940 --> 00:45:32,610
Just like how I killed Shangguan Hong
with my own hands back then.

851
00:45:36,380 --> 00:45:37,170
Huaiyi,

852
00:45:38,380 --> 00:45:41,380
transcend romantic attachments,

853
00:45:42,970 --> 00:45:44,530
and you'll be king.

854
00:46:01,420 --> 00:46:02,150
Understood.

855
00:46:17,940 --> 00:46:36,120
♪ There is a fiery woman in the brothel ♪

856
00:46:32,220 --> 00:46:33,050
Feiyan,

857
00:46:33,650 --> 00:46:34,940
back then,

858
00:46:36,170 --> 00:46:38,220
you used to warm up your voice

859
00:46:39,380 --> 00:46:40,420
and practice

860
00:46:41,650 --> 00:46:42,710
in this courtyard.

861
00:46:46,740 --> 00:46:48,820
I was so hopeless back then.

862
00:46:50,390 --> 00:46:51,550
I always liked to

863
00:46:52,260 --> 00:46:53,740
secretly watch you

864
00:46:54,170 --> 00:46:55,220
from afar.

865
00:46:56,260 --> 00:46:57,090
Just watching

866
00:46:58,260 --> 00:46:59,220
and watching...

867
00:47:02,780 --> 00:47:04,220
Until the day I saw you

868
00:47:05,050 --> 00:47:06,220
put on the makeup,

869
00:47:06,780 --> 00:47:07,910
step onto the stage,

870
00:47:08,130 --> 00:47:10,330
and win the applause of the whole house.

871
00:47:11,970 --> 00:47:14,490
I can no longer protect you anymore.

872
00:47:14,840 --> 00:47:15,570
Remember,

873
00:47:16,220 --> 00:47:18,890
you must fly higher...

874
00:47:20,170 --> 00:47:21,090
and go

875
00:47:21,490 --> 00:47:22,450
further.

876
00:48:28,740 --> 00:48:30,140
I'll just say a few words.

877
00:48:37,810 --> 00:48:38,740
Fourth Brother.

878
00:48:40,700 --> 00:48:41,820
Chengming,

879
00:48:43,860 --> 00:48:45,520
it was a pleasure knowing you.

880
00:48:45,530 --> 00:48:47,260
You'll be on your way tomorrow.

881
00:48:47,260 --> 00:48:48,380
Let's have a drink

882
00:48:48,380 --> 00:48:49,900
as my farewell to you.

883
00:48:50,300 --> 00:48:51,230
Fourth Brother,

884
00:48:51,820 --> 00:48:53,750
you're putting yourself in danger

885
00:48:54,050 --> 00:48:55,090
by visiting me.

886
00:48:55,450 --> 00:48:56,420
Don't worry.

887
00:48:56,700 --> 00:48:58,910
In Tianxiang Sect, I alone
master Western knowledge.

888
00:48:58,910 --> 00:49:00,910
Sect Master can't afford to kill me.

889
00:49:03,340 --> 00:49:04,790
I just hate myself for

890
00:49:05,570 --> 00:49:07,050
not being able to save you.

891
00:49:09,220 --> 00:49:10,150
Fourth Brother,

892
00:49:18,700 --> 00:49:20,570
please do me one last favor.

893
00:49:30,300 --> 00:49:31,160
Fourth Master,

894
00:49:31,300 --> 00:49:32,340
Sect Master ordered

895
00:49:32,340 --> 00:49:34,380
that no one
who's seen Shangguan Chengming

896
00:49:34,380 --> 00:49:35,530
is allowed to leave.

897
00:49:40,190 --> 00:49:43,190
With the war intensifying outside,

898
00:49:43,330 --> 00:49:45,210
word has come down from the top

899
00:49:46,090 --> 00:49:49,040
that Yucheng is now
our official rear base.

900
00:49:49,320 --> 00:49:50,880
With this decree,

901
00:49:50,940 --> 00:49:52,340
the military and police systems

902
00:49:52,340 --> 00:49:54,490
in Yucheng have undergone multiple purges.

903
00:49:54,490 --> 00:49:56,000
It's recent: the deputy director

904
00:49:56,000 --> 00:49:57,340
from headquarters,

905
00:49:57,340 --> 00:49:59,300
his name and identity are all kept secret.

906
00:49:59,300 --> 00:50:00,430
No one knows a thing.

907
00:50:01,050 --> 00:50:02,380
My words don't carry

908
00:50:02,700 --> 00:50:04,360
as much weight as they used to.

909
00:50:04,900 --> 00:50:06,130
It's hard enough

910
00:50:06,820 --> 00:50:09,420
to protect myself,
let alone help a friend out.

911
00:50:10,820 --> 00:50:12,530
Times are tough

912
00:50:12,530 --> 00:50:14,130
for everyone right now.

913
00:50:14,130 --> 00:50:15,740
But times like these are exactly when

914
00:50:15,740 --> 00:50:18,170
we buddies should help each other out.

915
00:50:18,200 --> 00:50:19,000
Tell you what,

916
00:50:19,070 --> 00:50:20,670
I'll give you an extra 10% cut

917
00:50:21,470 --> 00:50:23,220
from Tianxiang Sect's business—

918
00:50:23,220 --> 00:50:25,350
make life a little easier for you, bud.

919
00:50:25,570 --> 00:50:26,380
Truth be told,

920
00:50:26,380 --> 00:50:29,050
you're talking about
Tianxiang Sect's internal affairs,

921
00:50:29,050 --> 00:50:32,180
something a guy in uniform like me
can't get involved in.

922
00:50:33,200 --> 00:50:34,800
Then I'll add another 10%.

923
00:50:36,860 --> 00:50:37,990
How does that sound?

924
00:50:38,010 --> 00:50:40,650
You're truly a master of calculation.

925
00:50:40,680 --> 00:50:42,470
It's all thanks to you that

926
00:50:42,760 --> 00:50:45,430
I get to stick around in Yucheng.

927
00:50:48,670 --> 00:50:52,560
[Sever the Heavenly Light]

928
00:50:59,610 --> 00:51:00,810
Heaven hides no evil,

929
00:51:01,260 --> 00:51:02,790
and earth harbors no filth.

930
00:51:02,820 --> 00:51:04,780
Wang Jiaxian and Jiang Feiyan have

931
00:51:04,870 --> 00:51:06,270
violated the sect rules

932
00:51:06,600 --> 00:51:07,750
and shall be subjected

933
00:51:07,750 --> 00:51:09,750
to the human oil candle punishment.

934
00:51:09,780 --> 00:51:11,130
Cleansing Matron.

935
00:51:12,520 --> 00:51:13,440
Proceed.

936
00:51:13,840 --> 00:51:14,680
Yes.

937
00:51:19,260 --> 00:51:20,940
Today, we have rebellious disciples

938
00:51:20,940 --> 00:51:22,450
who disrupted our sect's order.

939
00:51:22,450 --> 00:51:24,450
Kill them! Kill them!

940
00:51:24,700 --> 00:51:26,820
First, we invite the past sect masters

941
00:51:26,820 --> 00:51:29,820
to witness your crime
of betraying the sect!

942
00:51:29,890 --> 00:51:31,890
Kill them! Kill them!

943
00:51:34,970 --> 00:51:37,090
Second, we invite our fellow disciples

944
00:51:37,090 --> 00:51:39,740
to jointly execute you for your treachery.

945
00:51:39,820 --> 00:51:41,450
Kill them! Kill them!

946
00:51:45,260 --> 00:51:47,420
Third, I summon the disciplinary artifacts

947
00:51:47,420 --> 00:51:49,450
to chastise you renegades!

948
00:51:49,450 --> 00:51:51,170
Kill them! Kill them!

949
00:52:00,390 --> 00:52:01,590
The time has come.

950
00:52:02,510 --> 00:52:03,430
Execute them.

951
00:52:41,010 --> 00:52:43,280
[In the next episode]

952
00:52:43,490 --> 00:52:45,530
Haven't you been dying to kill me?

953
00:52:46,490 --> 00:52:47,130
Come on.

954
00:52:48,010 --> 00:52:49,210
I'll grant your wish.

955
00:52:50,050 --> 00:52:51,170
What a rare guest.

956
00:52:51,810 --> 00:52:52,680
Do you need something?

957
00:52:52,680 --> 00:52:53,380
Yes.

958
00:52:53,380 --> 00:52:54,300
What is it?

959
00:52:56,010 --> 00:52:56,780
A life exchange.

960
00:52:56,780 --> 00:52:57,820
Are you done living?

961
00:52:57,820 --> 00:52:58,650
Long ago.

962
00:52:58,650 --> 00:52:59,700
Deal.

963
00:53:01,340 --> 00:53:02,540
How do you want to die?

964
00:53:03,170 --> 00:53:04,220
I get to choose?

965
00:53:05,220 --> 00:53:06,170
Sure.

966
00:53:06,170 --> 00:53:08,220
You're so ruthless.

967
00:53:08,740 --> 00:53:10,090
Not as evil as you.

968
00:53:12,650 --> 00:53:14,130
Let me tell you something.

969
00:53:15,540 --> 00:53:18,210
You've met the real Shangguan Chengming.
